data: {"id": "5f5fb7db9b5642cf-thinking-parallel_evidence-1097", "run_id": "5f5fb7db9b5642cf", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### Kubernetes 状态与事件\n- **Pod 当前状态**：`Pending`，`ContainerCreating`（与 upstream handoff 一致）\n- **调度节点**：`node2` (10.2.0.50)\n- **关键事件 1（multus, 60m–57m）**：`NoNetworkFound` — 在 namespace `aiops-case-05` 中找不到 `network-attachment-definition` \"unavailable-network\"。\n- **关键事件 2（kubelet, 60m–58m）**：`FailedCreatePodSandBox` — \"failed to setup network for sandbox due to missing delegate 'unavailable-network'\"。\n- **注解**：`k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network`，说明 Pod 通过 Multus 请求了外部网络附加定义。\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788781795453, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

